#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:0
msgid "7: ENABLE, PRIVDEFENA and HFNMIENA"
msgstr "7：ENABLE、PRIVDEFENA 和 HFNMIENA"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:181
msgid ""
"XN prohibits Code-domain instruction fetch; Strongly-ordered replaces the "
"Normal memory type that permits speculative reads. AP001 permits the eight "
"explicit CPU stores needed to program one 32-byte flashword. AP000 would "
"prevent those stores and is therefore unsuitable for the unified "
"program/erase path. AP001 also permits explicit reads: the independently "
"audited RAM graph must exclude them. This is not a blanket no-bus-access "
"permission check."
msgstr ""
"XN 禁止 Code 域取指；Strongly-ordered 替换允许推测读取的 Normal memory 类型。 AP001 允许编程一个 "
"32-byte flashword 所需的八次显式 CPU store。AP000 会阻止这些 store，因此不适用于统一的编程／擦除路径。AP001"
" 也允许显式读取：独立审查的 RAM 调用图必须排除这些读取。这不是一项全面禁止总线访问的权限检查。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:188
msgid ""
"The owner saves the exact observed CTRL and RNR before the first selector "
"write. After selecting region15 and observing that selection, it captures "
"the corresponding RBAR/RASR before the first descriptor write. The bridge's "
"independent r8-r11 captures prevent the final return gate from treating "
"mutable guard state as its own integrity proof. RBAR readback includes the "
"selected region number, so base comparisons mask the real register fields. "
"Disabled descriptor fields need not be zero and must survive restoration. "
"Readback and DSB/ISB prove guard installation before any program store or "
"erase START. HFNMIENA retains that policy in NMI/HardFault. The final "
"assembly gate independently checks restored CTRL, selected descriptor and "
"selector against its captures. Every temporary selector effect is recorded "
"before a write and cleared only after exact restore/readback. No ordinary "
"Flash-resident Arch or vendor MPU helper may be called during this window."
msgstr ""
"owner 在首次 selector 写入前保存精确观测到的 CTRL 和 RNR；选定 region15 并读回确认选择后，在首次描述符写入前捕获对应"
" RBAR/RASR。bridge 独立保存在 r8-r11 中的捕获值，避免最终返回 gate 将可变 guard 状态自身当作完整性证明。RBAR "
"读回包含选定 region 编号，因此基址比较按真实寄存器字段进行掩码处理。禁用描述符字段不必为零，恢复时必须保留。任何 program store 或"
" erase START 前，必须通过读回和 DSB/ISB 证明 guard 已安装。HFNMIENA 使该策略在 NMI/HardFault "
"中仍然有效。最终汇编 gate 对照捕获值独立检查已恢复的 CTRL、选定描述符和 selector。每次临时 selector "
"效果均在写入前记录，且只在精确恢复／读回后清除。在此窗口内不得调用普通 Flash 驻留 Arch 或 vendor MPU helper。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:201
msgid "A deadline expires; a physical pulse does not cancel"
msgstr "deadline 到期不能取消物理脉冲"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:203
msgid ""
"![FIG-18 target: deadline expiry latches a result while the RAM transaction "
"retains protection, waits for actual both-bank drain and restores state "
"before return](../assets/diagrams/h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-18 target：deadline 到期只锁存结果；RAM 事务保留保护，等待真实双 Bank "
"排空并恢复状态后才能返回](../assets/diagrams/h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:203
msgid ""
"FIG-18 target: deadline expiry latches a result while the RAM transaction "
"retains protection, waits for actual both-bank drain and restores state "
"before return"
msgstr "FIG-18 target：deadline 到期只锁存结果；RAM 事务保留保护，等待真实双 Bank 排空并恢复状态后才能返回"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:205
msgid ""
"FIG-18 shows protocol stages, not a new public request enum. Every arrow is "
"a guarded control-flow transition. The returning path requires the following"
" sequence; the terminal path has no edge back to ordinary code."
msgstr ""
"FIG-18 表示协议阶段，不新增公共 request "
"enum。每条箭头都是具有条件的控制流迁移。返回路径必须满足以下顺序；终止路径没有返回普通代码的边。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:209
msgid ""
"Reject invalid input or a deadline already expired before trigger. Prove "
"rollback of every acquired pre-trigger selector/protection effect while both"
" banks are idle. Every C transaction return, including rejected vector "
"publication and guard/deadline refusal, reaches the assembly gate on private"
" MSP. It proves both banks idle, zero retained guard effects, the exact "
"saved target control plus LOCK, and restored MPU hardware before restoring "
"VTOR. An unproved condition enters RAM fail-stop."
msgstr ""
"在 trigger 前拒绝无效输入或已到期 deadline。双 Bank 空闲时，证明已取得的每项 trigger 前 "
"selector／保护效果均已回滚。每条 C 事务返回路径，包括向量发布被拒绝以及 guard／deadline 拒绝，均在私有 MSP 上到达汇编 "
"gate。该 gate 在恢复 VTOR 前证明双 Bank 空闲、无保留 guard 效果、精确已保存目标 control 加 LOCK，以及 MPU"
" 硬件已恢复。任何无法证明的条件都进入 RAM fail-stop。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:216
msgid ""
"Stage a validated command and input, enter the RAM bridge, install RAM "
"vectors and prove the MPU guard before starting the physical operation."
msgstr "暂存已校验命令与输入，进入 RAM bridge，安装 RAM 向量，并在启动物理操作前证明 MPU guard。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:218
msgid ""
"Perform only the explicit validated program stores or erase START. Observe "
"real BSY/QW/WBNE for both banks and retain all command/workspace ownership."
msgstr "只执行已明确校验的编程 store 或擦除 START。观测两个 Bank 的真实 BSY/QW/WBNE，保留全部命令／工作区所有权。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:220
msgid ""
"If the absolute deadline expires after trigger, latch `TIMEOUT` and continue"
" actual RAM polling. Do not clear busy bits, withdraw protection, release "
"storage or jump to a Flash error handler to manufacture settlement."
msgstr ""
"触发后绝对 deadline 到期时，锁存 `TIMEOUT` 并继续真实 RAM 轮询。不得清除 busy 位、撤回保护、释放存储，或跳到 Flash"
" 错误 handler 制造已结清假象。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:223
msgid ""
"After both banks are actually idle, prove target LOCK, complete the required"
" barrier and restore/read back MPU state in C. The assembly return gate then"
" independently checks that hardware against the protected captures, restores"
" and reads back linker-known `g_pfnVectors`, and completes DSB/ISB. The "
"bridge may restore the exact caller context and return to ordinary code only"
" after this gate succeeds."
msgstr ""
"双 Bank 实际空闲后，在 C 中证明目标 LOCK、完成所需 barrier，并恢复／读回 MPU 状态。随后汇编返回 gate "
"对照受保护捕获值独立检查硬件，恢复并读回链接器已知的 `g_pfnVectors`，并完成 DSB/ISB。只有此 gate 成功后，bridge "
"才能恢复调用者的精确上下文并返回普通代码。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:229
msgid ""
"Report the settled result. Hardware failure reports `IO`; otherwise a "
"latched expiry reports `TIMEOUT`, and successful completion reports "
"`SUCCESS`."
msgstr "报告已结清结果。硬件失败报告 `IO`；否则已锁存到期报告 `TIMEOUT`，成功完成报告 `SUCCESS`。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:232
msgid ""
"Permanently busy hardware never reaches the returning path. It remains in "
"the RAM drain path with protection and storage retained. Unprovable lock, "
"protection, vector or time-domain state likewise takes a nonreturning RAM "
"fail-stop path. The bridge, its protected captures and the final hardware "
"gate are checked from actual ARM bytes; a named C return function or a zero "
"software ledger alone cannot authorize return. A host watchdog may observe "
"and terminate its isolated test process; that is not device drain or product"
" recovery. This design promises no hidden reset, watchdog service, RTOS "
"progress or bounded wall-time return."
msgstr ""
"永久 busy 的硬件不会到达返回路径；它停留于 RAM 排空路径并保留保护与存储。无法证明的 lock、保护、向量或时间域状态也进入非返回 RAM "
"fail-stop。bridge、受保护捕获值和最终硬件 gate 均按真实 ARM 字节检查；仅有一个具名 C 返回函数或为零的软件 "
"ledger，不能授权返回。host watchdog 可以观察并终止独立测试进程，但这不是设备排空或产品恢复。本设计不承诺隐藏复位、watchdog "
"服务、RTOS 推进或有界墙钟返回时间。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:241
msgid ""
"The selected deadline uses the existing TIM2 domain and epoch. Any wrap "
"extension must have an actual supported service/pulse bound; one pending UIF"
" cannot count an arbitrary number of masked wraps. A lost or exhausted epoch"
" cannot resume deadline consumers with a plausible zero. RTOS/SysTick "
"compensation and product time recovery require their own reviewed contract. "
"Long masked Flash maintenance does not inherit the short Arch critical-"
"section latency contract."
msgstr ""
"选定 deadline 使用既有 TIM2 时间域与 epoch。任何回绕扩展都必须具有实际可支持的 service／pulse 上界；单个待处理 "
"UIF 不能计数屏蔽期间任意多次回绕。丢失或耗尽的 epoch 不能以貌似合理的零继续向 deadline consumer "
"提供时间。RTOS/SysTick 补偿和产品时间恢复需要各自审查的合同。长时间屏蔽中断的 Flash 维护不能继承 Arch 短临界区的延迟合同。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:248
msgid "CPU protection does not quiesce the system"
msgstr "CPU 保护不能替代系统静止"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:250
msgid ""
"This MPU guard constrains the CPU. It neither stops DMA1/2, MDMA, Ethernet, "
"USB, display engines and debug access nor joins their late IRQ or "
"publication paths. Before calling maintenance, the external owner must "
"withdraw and join every master that can access the busy Flash domain, "
"including descriptors and input sources, or supply an independently proved "
"disjoint plan. Address ranges alone do not prove that a worker or bus master"
" has stopped."
msgstr ""
"该 MPU guard 约束 CPU，不会停止 DMA1/2、MDMA、Ethernet、USB、显示引擎和调试访问，也不会 join 它们迟到的 "
"IRQ 或 publication 路径。调用维护前，外部 owner 必须撤回并 join 每个能访问忙 Flash 域的 "
"master，包括描述符与输入源；或者提供独立证明的互不干扰计划。地址范围本身不能证明 worker 或总线 master 已停止。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:257
msgid ""
"The same caller must choose how its product tolerates masked interrupts, "
"watchdog expiry, power failure and a nonreturning fault. The platform does "
"not select these policies or infer them from a Board reference. This design "
"does not admit Cache-on programming, enabled foreign MPU regions, bank swap,"
" option/OTP writes, every H7 cut, bootloader adoption or runtime clock "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"同一调用者还必须决定产品如何容忍中断屏蔽、看门狗到期、掉电和不返回故障。平台不选择这些策略，也不根据 Board 参考推断策略。本设计不准入 "
"Cache-on 编程、已启用的外来 MPU region、bank swap、option/OTP 写入、所有 H7 cut、bootloader "
"接管或运行期时钟变化。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:263
msgid "Keep cost and evidence tied to the actual bytes"
msgstr "将成本与证据绑定实际字节"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:265
msgid ""
"Selected-only source and instance generation must keep unselected images "
"free of the RAM pod, workspace and calls. Actual selected/unselected ELF "
"comparison must separately report Flash LOAD/footprint, copied executable "
"bytes, static RAM, alignment padding and the real call/exception stack "
"requirement. An array size or host `sizeof` is not linked cost, measured "
"stack use, throughput or WCET. This page makes no measured cost, stack high-"
"water, throughput or WCET claim."
msgstr ""
"按选择生成 source 与实例时，未选入镜像不得含 RAM 执行区、工作区或调用。实际 selected/unselected ELF "
"比较必须分别报告 Flash LOAD／footprint、复制的可执行字节、静态 RAM、对齐填充，以及实际调用／异常栈需求。数组大小或 host "
"`sizeof` 不是链接成本、实测栈使用、吞吐量或 WCET。本页不声明测得成本、栈高水位、吞吐量或 WCET。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:272
msgid ""
"The selected PLL384 peripheral reference is authored once in [h743-high-"
"peripherals.toml](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/h743-high-peripherals.toml)."
" The maintained catalogue, normal preset, generated host factory and "
"installed Source SDK consumer use that same input. Moving its source "
"authority does not change its V-cut, baremetal, Cache-off or `poll-word` "
"restrictions."
msgstr ""
"选定的 PLL384 外设参考仅在 [h743-high-peripherals.toml](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/h743-high-peripherals.toml) "
"中手写一次。维护的装配清单、普通 preset、生成的宿主 factory 和已安装的 Source SDK consumer "
"均使用同一输入。移动其源码权威位置不会改变 V 修订、baremetal、Cache-off 或 `poll-word` 限制。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:278
msgid ""
"The existing `performance.yml` qualification-only path accepts this "
"canonical input with an explicit `gpio` workload and exact source SHA. That "
"workload starts the selected Platform and exercises GPIO; it does not fetch "
"the public Flash face. RAM-pod retention alone therefore does not prove "
"retention of every public Flash operation. The installed public Flash "
"consumer and exact linked retention checks remain separate evidence. A "
"successful future run can establish only its actual source, image and "
"reproduced scope; it does not close the full IO-24 exit or change physical "
"HIL from `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"既有 `performance.yml` 中仅执行资格验证的路径接受此规范输入，并要求显式的 `gpio` 工作负载和精确的源码 "
"SHA。该工作负载启动选定的 Platform 并执行 GPIO；它不获取公共 Flash face。因此，仅在链接镜像中保留 RAM "
"pod，不能证明每个公共 Flash 操作也都已保留。已安装的公共 Flash consumer "
"和精确链接保留检查仍须作为独立证据。未来运行即使成功，也只能建立其实际源码、镜像和复现范围内的证据；它不关闭完整 IO-24 退出条件，也不将物理 "
"HIL 从 `not_executed` 改为已执行。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:287
msgid ""
"The same ELF audit reports `public_flash_linkage`. `retained_verified` means"
" the observed readonly operation table contains four Thumb pointers "
"associated with the known public operations in `flash.c`. `not_retained` "
"means the named table was not observed. `retained_not_proved` preserves "
"retained executable targets whose method identity cannot be proved after LTO"
" renaming or missing metadata; it neither rejects a valid build nor claims "
"verified method identity. Explicit null, non-Thumb or recognized invalid "
"entries still reject. This distinction does not relax the existing RAM "
"closure proof; RAM-pod retention cannot replace public-face linkage "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"同一 ELF 审计报告 `public_flash_linkage`。`retained_verified` 表示观测到的只读操作表包含四个 Thumb"
" 指针，并已关联到 `flash.c` 中已知公共操作。`not_retained` "
"表示没有观测到该命名操作表。`retained_not_proved` 保留这样的事实：可执行目标仍在，但因 LTO "
"重命名或元数据不足，无法证明方法身份；它既不拒绝合法构建，也不声称已验证方法身份。显式空指针、非 Thumb "
"指针或已识别的非法条目仍被拒绝。这一区分不放宽现有 RAM 闭包证明；RAM pod 保留不能替代公共 face 链接证据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:297
msgid ""
"`linked_resources` reports whole-image allocation through the existing "
"resource observer. The RAM pod and workspace are subsets of those totals, "
"not additional allocations to sum again. These observations audit actual "
"linked bytes; they do not execute a Flash pulse, establish a stack peak or "
"measure busy-bank behavior."
msgstr ""
"`linked_resources` 通过既有资源观察器报告整镜像分配。RAM pod 和 workspace "
"是这些总量的子集，不能再次相加。这些观测审计实际链接字节，不执行 Flash 编程脉冲、不建立栈峰值，也不测量 busy-bank 行为。"

