#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:311
msgid ""
"Synthetic checker fixtures establish only their checker behavior. Host "
"register models do not measure the real branch predictor, bus contention or "
"IRQ latency. The physical RAM functions and exception entries name the "
"existing generated workspace, existing System epoch and official MMIO "
"identities directly. The assembly return gate consumes the C result and "
"protected MPU captures; it checks drain, LOCK, restored protection and the "
"fixed original vector before caller restoration. Byte-defined checks reject "
"missing/reordered reads, comparisons, barriers or failure branches rather "
"than trusting a function name or argument."
msgstr ""
"合成 checker 夹具只证明其相应 checker 行为。host 寄存器模型不测量真实分支预测器、总线竞争或 IRQ 延迟。物理 RAM "
"函数及异常入口直接使用既有生成工作区、既有 System epoch 和官方 MMIO 身份。汇编返回 gate 接收 C 结果及受保护 MPU "
"捕获值；它在恢复调用者前检查排空、LOCK、保护已恢复及固定原始向量。按真实字节定义的检查会拒绝读取、比较、barrier "
"或失败分支的缺失或重排，不依赖函数名或调用实参作为证明。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:320
msgid ""
"A passing selected audit establishes its bounded explicit-operand and return"
" protocol proof under the stated caller, compiler and ownership "
"preconditions. It is not a general C interpreter, speculative-bus "
"measurement or hardware qualification. Missing production proof remains an "
"open exit. The {download}`IO-01–42 ledger <io-evolution-execution.csv>` "
"remains the implementation-status authority; per-profile execution, source "
"identities, SDK checks and remaining software-candidate obligations belong "
"in delivery evidence."
msgstr ""
"选定审计通过，表示在已声明调用者、编译器和所有权前提下，取得其有界显式操作数及返回协议证明；它不是通用 C "
"解释器、推测总线访问测量或硬件资格。缺失的生产证明仍是开放退出项。{download}`IO-01–42 台账 <io-evolution-"
"execution.csv>` 仍为实现状态权威；逐配置执行、源码身份、SDK 检查和剩余软件候选义务记录在交付证据中。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:328
msgid ""
"The implementation is split between [cold preparation and "
"admission](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_owner.c), the [CPU bridge and "
"assembly return gate](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_enter.S), [RAM "
"vector publication](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_transaction.c), "
"the [MPU transaction](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_mpu.c) and [physical "
"pulse/time observations](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram.c). Their private"
" workspace and checked C/assembly prefix are declared in [the RAM "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/private/stm32h743_flash_ram.h). These links "
"locate current work; they do not substitute for the required execution and "
"production-ELF evidence."
msgstr ""
"实现分为[冷态准备与准入](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_owner.c)、[CPU bridge 与汇编返回 "
"gate](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_enter.S)、[RAM "
"向量发布](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_transaction.c)、[MPU "
"事务](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_mpu.c)和[物理脉冲／时间观测](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram.c)。私有工作区与已核对的 C／汇编前缀在[RAM "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/private/stm32h743_flash_ram.h)中声明。这些链接用于定位当前工作，不能替代所需执行和生产"
" ELF 证据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:338
msgid ""
